@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Root / health check (public, no login required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### STEP 1: Log in first — open this URL in your BROWSER (not this REST client),
### complete the Google consent screen, then come back here.
### GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google

### Check who's currently logged in (uses the browser session cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/user

### Log out
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### --- Everything below requires an active login session ---

### Create a project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "Calendar Agent",
  "context": "Internal tool that converts sprint planning prompts into scheduled tasks."
}

### Get all projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### Generate user stories from a prompt (calls Gemini)
POST {{baseUrl}}/userStories/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Plan a two-week sprint to add user authentication with OAuth login and password reset."
}

### Get all pending user stories
GET {{baseUrl}}/userStories

### Get a single user story by id (replace :id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/userStories/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Approve a user story (replace :id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/userStories/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### Delete a user story (replace :id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/userStories/REPLACE_WITH_ID
